Counter-only vertex input reuse profile (RSX_PERF_VTXREG=1, default off, with RSX_PERF=1 RSX_PERF_PROF=A,B).

For every draw that reached the vertex stage inside the window: served by the device vertex cache, or fetched; a fetched draw is
classified against the previous fetched draw (attribute words, batches/source spans, a byte compare against a copy of the previous
source bytes, and the tracked-write page test). Prints [perf-vtxreg] when the window closes. The classifier is the pure header
libs/video/rsx_vtx_reg.h (host test tools/smoke/test_vtx_reg.sh). No decision reads any counter.

